{"2834910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rocksmith+", "steam_appid": 2834910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Comparison Grid</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/a085e20828559eb66a67fc0af50d31a7.avif?t=1781541147\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAME METHOD AS BEFORE, START FOR FREE</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/e7bbdd82550a1b70894314a00b2e6bea.poster.avif?t=1781541147\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/e7bbdd82550a1b70894314a00b2e6bea.webm?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/e7bbdd82550a1b70894314a00b2e6bea.mp4?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Rocksmith+ builds on the award-winning Rocksmith 2014 method, now delivered as a modern, evolving music learning service. Start for free with lessons and a selection of 20 songs using real-time feedback and practice tools. A subscription unlocks the full catalog of licensed hit songs, while Rocksmith 2014 remains available for players who prefer to buy and own their music.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUBSCRIBE TO ACCESS A GROWING LIBRARY OF SONGS YOU LOVE</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/29302a077b2b088d804f7a23edd5e35e.poster.avif?t=1781541147\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/29302a077b2b088d804f7a23edd5e35e.webm?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/29302a077b2b088d804f7a23edd5e35e.mp4?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Instantly unlock thousands of songs across rock, metal, pop, and beyond, with monthly additions from music icons like Coldplay, Oasis, Billy Joel, Green Day, or The Doors; metal and hard rock legends such as Metallica, Ghost, Korn, Linkin Park, and Paramore; as well as today’s global stars, including Alicia Keys, Bad Bunny, Billie Eilish, and many more. Curated playlists guide your practice, with new tracks added across all genres.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROCKSMITH+ ADAPTS AS YOU PLAY</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/848cee49f2a8aa537eeed10a54854ac0.poster.avif?t=1781541147\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/848cee49f2a8aa537eeed10a54854ac0.webm?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/848cee49f2a8aa537eeed10a54854ac0.mp4?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Rocksmith+ listens to every note and adjusts difficulty in real time, becoming easier when you struggle and ramping up when you’re ready. Whatever your level, go further at your own pace with expert video lessons and dedicated learning tools like Riff Repeater, Practice Presets, and Skills Profiles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY ONLINE ACROSS DEVICES AND INSTRUMENTS</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/305bde64ffbf31c8a9ec09bbc4ec3d05.poster.avif?t=1781541147\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/305bde64ffbf31c8a9ec09bbc4ec3d05.webm?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/305bde64ffbf31c8a9ec09bbc4ec3d05.mp4?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play on PC, PlayStation®, or mobile with one account. Switch between guitar, bass, and piano, and pick up exactly where you left off, wherever you are.", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAME METHOD AS BEFORE, START FOR FREE</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/e7bbdd82550a1b70894314a00b2e6bea.poster.avif?t=1781541147\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/e7bbdd82550a1b70894314a00b2e6bea.webm?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/e7bbdd82550a1b70894314a00b2e6bea.mp4?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Rocksmith+ builds on the award-winning Rocksmith 2014 method, now delivered as a modern, evolving music learning service. Start for free with lessons and a selection of 20 songs using real-time feedback and practice tools. A subscription unlocks the full catalog of licensed hit songs, while Rocksmith 2014 remains available for players who prefer to buy and own their music.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUBSCRIBE TO ACCESS A GROWING LIBRARY OF SONGS YOU LOVE</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/29302a077b2b088d804f7a23edd5e35e.poster.avif?t=1781541147\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/29302a077b2b088d804f7a23edd5e35e.webm?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/29302a077b2b088d804f7a23edd5e35e.mp4?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Instantly unlock thousands of songs across rock, metal, pop, and beyond, with monthly additions from music icons like Coldplay, Oasis, Billy Joel, Green Day, or The Doors; metal and hard rock legends such as Metallica, Ghost, Korn, Linkin Park, and Paramore; as well as today’s global stars, including Alicia Keys, Bad Bunny, Billie Eilish, and many more. Curated playlists guide your practice, with new tracks added across all genres.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROCKSMITH+ ADAPTS AS YOU PLAY</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/848cee49f2a8aa537eeed10a54854ac0.poster.avif?t=1781541147\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/848cee49f2a8aa537eeed10a54854ac0.webm?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/848cee49f2a8aa537eeed10a54854ac0.mp4?t=1781541147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Rocksmith+ listens to every note and adjusts difficulty in real time, becoming easier when you struggle and ramping up when you’re ready. Whatever your level, go further at your own pace with expert video lessons and dedicated learning tools like Riff Repeater, Practice Presets, and Skills Profiles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY ONLINE ACROSS DEVICES AND INSTRUMENTS</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834910/extras/305bde64ffbf31c8a9ec09bbc4ec3d05.poster.avi